OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity said she had suffered
OL,7,Fmultiple injuries, including a head
OL,8,Ftilt caused by trauma and a fractured
OL,9,Ftail, with veterinary evidence
OL,10,Findicating they were consistent with
OL,11,Fphysical abuse.
